{"text": "The project aimed to address issues related to information sourcing from social media platforms.", "dimensions": ["objectives"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt93__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
{"text": "The project is called InSite: We Make News Social.", "dimensions": ["objectives"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt93__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "The project aims to address biases in popular news corporations and information conglomerates.", "dimensions": ["objectives"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt93__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "The project seeks to promote a more democratic flow of information.", "dimensions": ["objectives"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt93__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "The project intends to empower individuals to share news and information collectively.", "dimensions": ["objectives"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt93__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "Brandon Koussa is associated with the InSite project.", "dimensions": ["team"], "type": "team_member", "primary_dimension": "team", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt93__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "The project highlights the issue of personal biases of reporters and the ideologies of their funders.", "dimensions": ["innovation"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "innovation", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt93__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "The project criticizes the centralization of information that limits access to reliable news.", "dimensions": ["innovation"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "innovation", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt93__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "The project aims to counteract the polarization of issues in news reporting.", "dimensions": ["innovation"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "innovation", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt93__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "The project addresses the problem of key issues being underreported or ignored in mainstream media.", "dimensions": ["innovation"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "innovation", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt93__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "The project proposes to shift the control of news dissemination from centralized structures to individuals.", "dimensions": ["strategy"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "strategy", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt93__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "The project emphasizes the need for a free flow of information.", "dimensions": ["objectives"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt93__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "The project aims to create a platform for users to share their experiences and news.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt93__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "The project is positioned as a response to the challenges posed by social media in spreading information.", "dimensions": ["strategy"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "strategy", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt93__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "The project intends to create a more inclusive dialogue around news and information.", "dimensions": ["objectives"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt93__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "The project is designed to combat the limitations of existing news structures.", "dimensions": ["innovation"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "innovation", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt93__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "The project aims to enhance public access to diverse sources of information.", "dimensions": ["objectives"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt93__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "The project seeks to challenge the existing narrative control by news broadcasters.", "dimensions": ["innovation"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "innovation", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt93__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "The project is presented as a solution to the problems of biased news reporting.", "dimensions": ["objectives"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt93__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "InSite is a News Sharing app designed to provide news and information first hand by users.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt93__openai", "chunk_index": 2, "char_start": 2800, "char_end": 4600}}
{"text": "The aim of InSite is to remove bias and censorship in news reporting.", "dimensions": ["objectives"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt93__openai", "chunk_index": 2, "char_start": 2800, "char_end": 4600}}
{"text": "InSite allows users to control what they see and what gets reported on.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt93__openai", "chunk_index": 2, "char_start": 2800, "char_end": 4600}}
{"text": "InSite features a location-based verification system that allows users to upvote or downvote posts.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "innovation", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt93__openai", "chunk_index": 2, "char_start": 2800, "char_end": 4600}}
{"text": "Users can decide what news is most important to them through the upvote or downvote system.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt93__openai", "chunk_index": 2, "char_start": 2800, "char_end": 4600}}
{"text": "The main interface of the InSite app contains a map of the user's position.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt93__openai", "chunk_index": 2, "char_start": 2800, "char_end": 4600}}
